# Rename Ask to Order

Status: DONE
Milestone: M49 Consistent Order action labels
Dependencies: 52_LARGER_TITLES_OPAQUE_NOTEBOOK_TABS.todo

## Purpose

Rename the cake action without changing contact destinations or treating a link
click as a confirmed order.

## Tasks

- [x] Rename all15compact labels and accessible names; update full static labels.
- [x] Preserve every contact URL and the existing enquiry handoff.
- [x] Keep the longer word readable in short landscape without smaller type.
