## Acceptance criteria

- Compact Order, static Order this cake / Order these chocolates, named accessible links.
- Same contact destinations and confirmation wording; no automatic ordering.
- Four-photo pages and20pxaction text; no clipped labels or new fallback from the rename.
- Preserve all real media and separate local4174source.

